 - **[React](https://react.dev/)**: Used for UI components.
 - **[Tailwind CSS](https://tailwindcss.com/)**: For styling the application.
 - **[Astro DB](https://docs.astro.build/en/guides/database/)**: Powers the comments feature, using a libSQL-compatible database.
+
+## Sign-up phone verification
+
+Sign-up sends a 6-digit one-time passcode over SMS and verifies it before the account is created
+(`src/pages/api/signup/send-code.ts` and `verify.ts`). The challenge is stored hashed in the Astro session.
+Messages end with the origin-bound `@<host> #<code>` line so Chrome's WebOTP API and Safari's
+`autocomplete="one-time-code"` autofill can extract the code automatically (requires HTTPS or `localhost`).
+
+- Set `SMS_WEBHOOK_URL` (and optionally `SMS_WEBHOOK_TOKEN`) to deliver messages through a provider relay as `{ to, body }`.
+- Without it, messages are logged to the server console. In `astro dev`, the code is also shown in the form.
